Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Catégorie

###  Créer la racine "Accessoire"

POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nom": "Accessoire",
  "description": "Tous les accessoires",
  "slug": "accessoire"
}

### Créer "Téléphone" (enfant d'Accessoire)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nom": "Power Bank",
  "description": "Batteries externes et chargeurs portables",
  "slug": "power-bank",
  "parentId": 1
}

### Créer "Google Pixel"
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nom": "Galaxy A54",
  "slug": "samsung-galaxy-a54",
  "parentId": 24
}

